    <item>
      <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>Fall Regatta (19 Sep 2026)</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/f_hp_2026_fallregatta3_1920x1080.jpg" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;Fall Regatta is an annual STYC event that features up to three races in one day, each with a 2.5 hour time limit, during a time of year that the wind commonly allows for some exciting and dynamic courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <link>https://www.styc.org/event-6475354</link>
      <guid>https://www.styc.org/event-6475354</guid>
      <dc:creator />
    </item>
    <item>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>Race Your House (20 Sep 2026)</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/F_hp_2026_ryh_1920x1080.jpg" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/racepages/raceyourhouse/ryh3.JPG" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ahoy live-aboard sailors and racers!&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Race Your House&lt;/strong&gt; is THE race for those who live-aboard. The only requirements are that your boat is seaworthy and the vessel is used by the owner as their principal place of residence.&amp;nbsp; It is not necessary that you be a member of STYC or any organized yacht club. STYC will give all boats without a current rating, a provisional rating, with credit(s) given for typical cruising equipment and current sail and bottom condition.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Come show off your home to other sailors and racers then join us afterwards for a fun party and awards at the Sloop!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <link>https://www.styc.org/event-6475356</link>
      <guid>https://www.styc.org/event-6475356</guid>
      <dc:creator />
    </item>
