    <item>
      <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>NEW: Everett Marina Fall Cruise (17 Oct 2026)</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration to open Mid-Sept.....&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="center"&gt;&lt;font face="Impact" style="font-size: 36px;"&gt;Everett Marina Fall Cruise&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="center"&gt;&lt;font face="Impact" style="font-size: 36px;"&gt;Oct 17/18&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Yet another New location for our cruisers/racers to explore. Please join us at the updated expanded Everett Marina for our October overnight where we will be slipped together and have the use of the marina's event float, BBQ, &amp;amp; Pagoda for our mid-autumn Happy Hour.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#172A30" face="Gotham Book, sans-serif"&gt;The Port of Everett Marina also offers 2,300 slips close to restaurants, marine businesses, shops, trails, activities and more. As well as fuel, boat yard, pump outs, laundry, electric, &amp;amp; showers. Time to explore what offerings are there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#172A30" face="Gotham Book, sans-serif"&gt;Because the surrounding area offers several restaurants &amp;amp; breweries very close I suggest inquiring about food reservation policy options prior arrival, for following our 5 pm Happy Hour. Likewise, everyone is also welcome to remain on the party float to cook their own dinners &amp;amp; to socialize around a propane fire while the weather is still good.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font color="#172A30" face="Gotham Book, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;Look for more information to come..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;&lt;font face="Impact"&gt;Please register here:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.styc.org/event-6762793" target="_blank"&gt;https://www.styc.org/event-6762793&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;font face="Impact"&gt;Everett Marina Webpage:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;a href="https://cms9.revize.com/revize/everett/marina/rendezvous___events.php" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;https://cms9.revize.com/revize/everett/marina/rendezvous___events.php&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;font face="Impact" style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;Marina Map:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://cms9files.revize.com/everett/Document%20Center/Marina/Port%20of%20Everett%20Marina%20Map.pdf"&gt;&lt;font color="#4DBFF0"&gt;https://cms9files.revize.com/everett/Document%20Center/Marina/Port%20of%20Everett%20Marina%20Map.pdf&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif, WaWebKitSavedSpanIndex_3"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Waitlist&lt;/strong&gt; has been attached to this event. Please consider signing up regardless if this event is Full. There are &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;always&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; cancellations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p align="left"&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif, WaWebKitSavedSpanIndex_3"&gt;&lt;span&gt;See you there! Kristina, STYC Cruise Chair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <link>https://www.styc.org/event-6762793</link>
      <guid>https://www.styc.org/event-6762793</guid>
      <dc:creator />
    </item>
    <item>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>Great Pumpkin Race (31 Oct 2026)</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/Event%20Content%20-%20Land/Great%20Pumpkin%202025%20for%20website.png" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/The%20Great%20Pumkin%20Race%20(1).png" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Calling All Spooky Slooper Troopers!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2025's Great Pumpkin Race is almost upon us.&amp;nbsp; We've made some calls and asked the Great Pumpkin to bring us wind for the now penultimate race in our season. Check out the SI's on the website for more information. We can't wait to see you out there squashing the competition!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your event coordinators have put together a fun event this year, "an" amount of candy and possibly some additional treats. We hope you can carve out some time to join us.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In case you don't podium in this race, there is an extra chance to satiate your Halloween gourd.&amp;nbsp; We invite crew to join the costume contest with a special prizes going to the boats with:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;The Best Boat Crew Costumes&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;Scariest Costume&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;"Sloopiest" Slooper for the individual who really squashes the rest of the competition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please Join us for awards and celebration.&amp;nbsp; Time and location TBD.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Skipper's Meeting will be held on Friday, October 17th at the Fall Membership/Volunteer Appreciation Party held at Salmon Bay Eagles.&amp;nbsp; An online option will be available.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 1em;"&gt;See you all on the water!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <link>https://www.styc.org/event-6475357</link>
      <guid>https://www.styc.org/event-6475357</guid>
      <dc:creator />
    </item>
