    <item>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Dec 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>2026 Cruising Bingo (5 Dec 2026)</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/Event%20Content%20-%20Cruising/Bingo/cruising-bingo-2026-graphic-1920x1080.jpg" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Take a photo of yourself and/or your crew and/or your boat(s) at the location and email it to &lt;a href="mailto:reciprocal@styc.org" target="_blank"&gt;reciprocal@styc.org&lt;/a&gt;. Please be aware that photos may be used to promote the Sloop Tavern Yacht club!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you're shy a photo or screenshot of your chartplotter is also okay.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you use social media, please post and tag with #STYC&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.styc.org/resources/Pictures/Event%20Content%20-%20Cruising/Bingo/Cruising-Bingo-2026.png" alt="" title="" border="0"&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instructions:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;ul style="color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font: 14px &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;; list-style: outside; margin: 1em 0px 1em 18px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" align="start"&gt;
  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;Travel to five destinations in a row/column/diagonal and take photo evidence you were there to make bingo!&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span&gt;Remember to take advantage of our excellent &lt;a href="https://www.styc.org/reciprocal" target="_blank"&gt;reciprocal moorage&lt;/a&gt; program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;If you complete a single bingo, you can continue to complete additional bingos on the same card or request a more difficult card for an additional challenge.&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;Volunteer!&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span&gt;STYC is an all volunteer club. Email &lt;a href="mailto:volunteer@styc.org" target="_blank"&gt;volunteer@styc.org&lt;/a&gt; for great opportunities including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="list-style: none; display: inline"&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
      &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;PRO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

      &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Party Helper&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

      &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Committee Boat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

      &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Appointed Board Position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

      &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Elected Board Member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
  &lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000"&gt;STYC Social Events include Spring &amp;amp; Fall Membership Parties, Volunteer Appreciation Party&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font face="Open Sans"&gt;Notes:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;ul style="color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font: 14px &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;; list-style: outside; margin: 1em 0px 1em 18px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" align="start"&gt;
  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;All STYC Cruise Registrants and their guests are expected to adhere to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.styc.org/policies" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(43, 144, 209); font: 14px &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;; text-decoration: none;"&gt;STYC Community Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;during the event, and follow proper reciprocal etiquette&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;Many reciprocals require you to fly your club burgee, some require you to present your member card.&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li style="padding: 0px; margin: 0.25em 0px;"&gt;Not all bingo locations are suitable for all boats - you are always responsible for safe operation of your vessel&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;Cruising Bingo is free to participate, but does not include moorage costs, and reciprocal requirements vary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;font color="#000000" style="font-size: 15px;"&gt;Some STYC organized cruises may have additional costs that are optional based on the activity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;&lt;font color="#000000"&gt;No need to actually use reciprocal moorage at the locations - we're just highlighting our Reciprocal program. Just be sure and and get to the location and get some evidence.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;

  &lt;li&gt;&lt;font color="#000000"&gt;Travel by boat is expected except to Sloop on land social events like the Volunteer Appreciation party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Awards will be presented at the &lt;strong&gt;Holiday Party&lt;/strong&gt; after our final cruise of the year, the &lt;a href="https://www.styc.org/cruise" target="_blank"&gt;Kingston Dark &amp;amp; Stormy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
